{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And he was in Keziv.</b> The name of the place. And I say that it was called Keziv because she stopped giving birth — the term of הָיוֹ תִהְיֶה לִי כְּמוֹ אַכְזָב (Jeremiah 15), אֲשֶׁר לֹא יְכַזְּבוּ מֵימָיו (Isaiah 58); and if not, what does it come to tell us? And in Bereshit Rabbah I saw: ״וַתִּקְרָא שְׁמוֹ שֵׁלָה״ and so on — she stopped."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:35.136285819Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}